      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker wants the interlocutor to explain what they support in the Financial Innovation and Technology for the 21st Century Act.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "This was the first time that crypto-specific bills were advanced in standalone votes rather than as part of larger pieces of legislation.",
        "confidence": 0.94
