        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Advancement of a crypto-related bill through a standalone vote indicates meaningful progress toward regulatory clarity.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The interlocutor has informed opinions on the financial innovation bill and its provisions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Standalone advancement of a bill signals bipartisan or significant cross-party interest in cryptocurrency policy.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that understanding individual stances on specific bills enhances discussion quality.",
