        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "A federal framework for regulating digital assets is necessary.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Congress needs to act urgently to provide regulatory clarity.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The SEC under Gary Gensler has used regulation by enforcement rather than formal rules.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Good actors in the crypto space should be allowed to innovate freely.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Gary Gensler has taken arbitrary and capricious actions against crypto innovators.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Bad actors in the crypto space should be held accountable.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Digital assets should be distinguished between those that are good actors and bad actors.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The current approach by the SEC amounts to weaponizing regulations against the entire crypto industry.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
